sequenceDiagram
    participant SurveyService
    participant SentimentService
    participant KafkaBroker
    participant NotificationService
    participant ReportingService

    SurveyService->>KafkaBroker: Publish [SurveyCreatedEvent] to topic 'survey-events'
    SentimentService->>KafkaBroker: Publish [SentimentAnalyzedEvent] to topic 'sentiment-events'
    
    KafkaBroker-->>NotificationService: Consume [SurveyCreatedEvent]
    NotificationService->>NotificationService: Send Emails/Alerts to Employees
    
    KafkaBroker-->>ReportingService: Consume [SentimentAnalyzedEvent]
    ReportingService->>ReportingService: Update Real-time Dashboards & Averages
